= Notes
Alice's site and this one are separate directories on separate nodes.
Links between them are ordinary absolute ynp:// addresses.
:: Etiquette
  Nothing is fetched until a reader opens a link.
> ynp://127.0.0.1:7302/home | Back to Bob's home
> ynp://127.0.0.1:7301/home | Alice's home
